<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τάρας</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αντος</span>, ὁ</span> and (acc. to <i><span class="en">
			Eust.
			1390.59
		</span></i>) ἡ, <u>Tarentum</u>, a town of
		Magna Graecia, on a river of the same name, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.24
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Th.
			6.34
		</span></i>, etc.: also pr. n. of the river-hero, <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			6.3.2
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Paus.
			10.10.8
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τάραντος ἀγλαὸν ὕδωρ</span>
		Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			8.21
		</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τᾰραντῖνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <u>Tarentine</u>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Τ. κόλπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					6.1.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -νη</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.1.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τ., ὁ</span>, <i>a Tarentine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.138
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταραντίνων πολιτεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					590
				</span></i>
			:—cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταραντῖνοι,
				Ταραντῖνον</span>.</div>
